arguments.text:
It returns `None`. `getzoneinfofile_stream()` (dateutil/zoneinfo/__init__.py lines 34–39) is:

    try:
        return BytesIO(get_data(__name__, ZONEFILENAME))
    except IOError as e:
        warnings.warn("I/O error({0}): {1}".format(e.errno, e.strerror))
        return None

So on `IOError` it emits a `UserWarning` with the message `I/O error(<errno>): <strerror>` and returns `None` (it does not re-raise).

